Subject: [PATCH 05/11] Notch: show volume, mic and brightness OSD in the
 dynamic island

Replace the bottom OSD popup with an indicator that takes over the compact
player pill: icon, level bar and percentage, with the pill widening while
it's shown. The Audio/Brightness listeners move to OsdService.
